{"4891910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Demeter", "steam_appid": 4891910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/extras/9c6478b84f03fc180c6cb781d3958d52.avif?t=1785744138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/extras_big/9c6478b84f03fc180c6cb781d3958d52.webp?t=1785744138 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3vs1 Asymmetrical Multiplayer </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the hunter...</strong> - choose from a roster of legendary monsters (Dracula, Francenstein's Monster, Striga, Mi-Go) and hunt the heores down before they outplay you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...or the prey</strong> - our heroes inspired by historical figueres (Doc Holiday, Lucy Westerna, Eugène-François Vidocq, Nel Rawlinson, Captain Nemo) are not strong enough to down the monster, but they have tricks, traps and magic to level the playing field </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperation is key</strong> - work with your team, find team synergies and outsmart the monster to win the match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes need to</strong> - gather resources, activate the pylons gathering the essence and perform a harvesting ritual during a nailbiting match finale where the monster is the strongest he can be... and he knows where to find you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster has to</strong> - track their prey, pick the weakest link and catch them before they finish their objective. If all heores are down, the Monster wins! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP or PvE</strong> - If you don't have a 4th player to play as the Monster you can always run a PvE game and try to outsmart a TRUE MONSTER</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/extras/7052b6243af670042c510e3becf98d4d.avif?t=1785744138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/extras_big/7052b6243af670042c510e3becf98d4d.webp?t=1785744138 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mutual invisibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both teams exist on two planes of existence, as the monster resides in the ghostly world, only able to materialize for a limited time. The monster needs to utilize his skills to track and defeat heroes, while heroes have to use their toolkit to get a warning ahead of the monster's attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/extras/834d233f466c7fea9a350417f1d29dbf.avif?t=1785744138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/extras_big/834d233f466c7fea9a350417f1d29dbf.webp?t=1785744138 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When Napoleon met Cthulu</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demeter is set in an alternate version of Earth where history was reshaped in the early 19th century. After being exiled to Elba, <strong>Napoleon struck a pact with the Great Cthulhu</strong>, returned to Europe, and with the help of <strong>Deep Ones</strong> and <strong>steam-powered technology</strong> won the campaign, and destroyed the armies of the Seventh Coalition during the <strong>Waterloo Slaughter</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/extras/9c6478b84f03fc180c6cb781d3958d52.avif?t=1785744138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/extras_big/9c6478b84f03fc180c6cb781d3958d52.webp?t=1785744138 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3vs1 Asymmetrical Multiplayer </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the hunter...</strong> - choose from a roster of legendary monsters (Dracula, Francenstein's Monster, Striga, Mi-Go) and hunt the heores down before they outplay you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...or the prey</strong> - our heroes inspired by historical figueres (Doc Holiday, Lucy Westerna, Eugène-François Vidocq, Nel Rawlinson, Captain Nemo) are not strong enough to down the monster, but they have tricks, traps and magic to level the playing field </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperation is key</strong> - work with your team, find team synergies and outsmart the monster to win the match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes need to</strong> - gather resources, activate the pylons gathering the essence and perform a harvesting ritual during a nailbiting match finale where the monster is the strongest he can be... and he knows where to find you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster has to</strong> - track their prey, pick the weakest link and catch them before they finish their objective. If all heores are down, the Monster wins! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP or PvE</strong> - If you don't have a 4th player to play as the Monster you can always run a PvE game and try to outsmart a TRUE MONSTER</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/extras/7052b6243af670042c510e3becf98d4d.avif?t=1785744138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/extras_big/7052b6243af670042c510e3becf98d4d.webp?t=1785744138 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mutual invisibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both teams exist on two planes of existence, as the monster resides in the ghostly world, only able to materialize for a limited time. The monster needs to utilize his skills to track and defeat heroes, while heroes have to use their toolkit to get a warning ahead of the monster's attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/extras/834d233f466c7fea9a350417f1d29dbf.avif?t=1785744138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/extras_big/834d233f466c7fea9a350417f1d29dbf.webp?t=1785744138 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When Napoleon met Cthulu</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demeter is set in an alternate version of Earth where history was reshaped in the early 19th century. After being exiled to Elba, <strong>Napoleon struck a pact with the Great Cthulhu</strong>, returned to Europe, and with the help of <strong>Deep Ones</strong> and <strong>steam-powered technology</strong> won the campaign, and destroyed the armies of the Seventh Coalition during the <strong>Waterloo Slaughter</strong>.</p>", "short_description": "Hunt your prey or outsmart the Monster as a team in this exciting 3v1 horror multiplayer where Napoleon met Cthulu and unleashed supernatural creatures onto the world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/a74a4853171ca841ca1f2dd769d7d18cf363514d/header.jpg?t=1785744138", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/c2b8571378565c2711864c1f2a15ee2fdb41ca41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785744138", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4891910/c2